    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1386">

                <pb facs="1310" n="1144" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg1144"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/1015</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Jefferson
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-16T14:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 16, 1917, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your October 12, 9 a.m. What arrangements have been made by Nicaraguan Government
                    for application to awards of Mixed Claims Commission and of Public Credit
                    Commission, of money now held by Ham on account of Ethelburga interests.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
